      "source": "This implementation simply calls <a href=\"#createRequest(java.net.URI,org.springframework.http.HttpMethod,org.springframework.http.client.ClientHttpRequestFactory)\"><code>createRequest(URI, HttpMethod, ClientHttpRequestFactory)</code></a>\nwith the wrapped request factory provided to the\n<a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.http.client.ClientHttpRequestFactory)\">constructor</a>.",
      "translation": "此实现简单地调用 <a href=\"#createRequest(java.net.URI,org.springframework.http.HttpMethod,org.springframework.http.client.ClientHttpRequestFactory)\"><code>createRequest(URI, HttpMethod, ClientHttpRequestFactory)</code></a>，并使用传递给<a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.http.client.ClientHttpRequestFactory)\">构造函数</a>的包装请求工厂。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
