      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"ClientHttpRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>ClientHttpRequest</code></a> for the specified URI and HTTP method\nby using the passed-on request factory.",
